{"id": "0510", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "And king Solomon shall be blessed, and the throne of David shall be established before the LORD for ever.", "target": [11, 2, 45], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.2289375, "sha256": "e5ddeffc4b1c3ae7a39df5cac4f50b70e9ce070bb0bc83913510f6c35688342a", "transcript": "and King Solomon shall be blessed, and the throne of David shall be established before the Lord forever.", "decode_s": 0.5544783329823986, "cpu_s": 0.020437999999999956, "rtf": 0.08901651894603191, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 2, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0515", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "But if he thus say, I have no delight in thee; behold, here am I, let him do to me as seemeth good unto him.", "target": [10, 15, 26], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.5975, "sha256": "4b2fa02641bfa26699fea6d5096de5095a43a63fa6265ecabbc02de0f8b02d7f", "transcript": "But if he thus say, I have no delight in thee, behold, here am I, let him do to me as seemeth good unto him.", "decode_s": 0.5832990000490099, "cpu_s": 0.02514599999999989, "rtf": 0.08841212581265781, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0520", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Thou hast borne thy lewdness and thine abominations, saith the LORD .", "target": [26, 16, 58], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.91075, "sha256": "f7170bf164f13991382702c5365ba39d1d940ce3889a7e6c2b013e8552a1436c", "transcript": "Thou hast borne thy lewdness and thine abominations, say of the Lord.", "decode_s": 0.5550271250540391, "cpu_s": 0.019055999999999962, "rtf": 0.14192344820150585, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 2, "units": 11, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0525", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "And the people answered and said, God forbid that we should forsake the LORD , to serve other gods;", "target": [6, 24, 16], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.0161875, "sha256": "6eed5eb81be57ccab01d02f5b1b78c898c38bf34136367aff8fde8f90a3ef67f", "transcript": "And the people answered and said, God forbid that we should forsake the Lord, to serve other gods.", "decode_s": 0.5598017090233043, "cpu_s": 0.020974999999999966, "rtf": 0.0930492457263515, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 18, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0530", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "There is treasure to be desired and oil in the dwelling of the wise; but a foolish man spendeth it up.", "target": [20, 21, 20], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.9225625, "sha256": "1925831db443bb4d372123fe5667b2aa9bfbbe7b9c180d1c76bd47faeb8aef7a", "transcript": "There is treasure to be desired and oil in the dwelling of the wise, but a foolish man spendeth it up.", "decode_s": 0.5681227080058306, "cpu_s": 0.02194499999999988, "rtf": 0.11541198471443088, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 21, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0535", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "I am for peace: but when I speak, they are for war.", "target": [19, 120, 7], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.638375, "sha256": "b1ef31df779fbeb44a39784b03eb2099f4e71d2e04790aa967ec13bd0bfcb67e", "transcript": "I am for peace, but when I speak, they are for war.", "decode_s": 0.5503525420790538, "cpu_s": 0.01578999999999997, "rtf": 0.1512632815691219, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 12, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0540", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Wilt thou kill me, as thou diddest the Egyptian yesterday?", "target": [44, 7, 28], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.761625, "sha256": "4af65beb223f896b9234ea9f818462b84110b784e15caba11cbb4b0e6ca127fa", "transcript": "Wilt thou kill me, as thou didst the Egyptian yesterday?", "decode_s": 0.5467196250101551, "cpu_s": 0.013847000000000165, "rtf": 0.14534134184299474, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 1, "units": 10, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0545", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Then said Jesus unto him, Put up again thy sword into his place: for all they that take the sword shall perish with the sword.", "target": [40, 26, 52], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.8741875, "sha256": "845b990c70da73a0a77fbc5deaf11115e5ca1f1f371ddc08e44df78dea691f5b", "transcript": "Then said Jesus unto him, Put up again thy sword into his place, for all they that take the sword shall perish with the sword.", "decode_s": 0.581683750031516, "cpu_s": 0.02462199999999992, "rtf": 0.08461854583272801, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0550", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "The world cannot hate you; but me it hateth, because I testify of it, that the works thereof are evil.", "target": [43, 7, 7], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.88675, "sha256": "15de9ab82d2597e3f4962ed2b1caf74a495ccf5160020f202485eefd8b50e62a", "transcript": "The world cannot hate you, but me it hadeth, because I testify of it, that the works thereof are evil.", "decode_s": 0.5830894169630483, "cpu_s": 0.023129999999999873, "rtf": 0.09905116014151243, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 1, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0555", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Howbeit that was not first which is spiritual, but that which is natural; and afterward that which is spiritual.", "target": [46, 15, 46], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 7.388125, "sha256": "de2762be15398de3f34dd14ded53879a13acd63dd04da1a23517aa04671dea57", "transcript": "Howbeit that was not first which is spiritual, but that which is natural, and afterward that which is spiritual.", "decode_s": 0.5687373750843108, "cpu_s": 0.022488000000000063, "rtf": 0.07697993402714637, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0560", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Howbeit the king of the children of Ammon hearkened not unto the words of Jephthah which he sent him.", "target": [7, 11, 28], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.7358125, "sha256": "1767cc7a13e1eb3202b325a37793cc2a5f1d60d0f1e026a0f2d0f385fe900201", "transcript": "Howbeit the king of the children of Ammon hearkened not unto the words of Jephthah which he sent him.", "decode_s": 0.5783925000578165, "cpu_s": 0.022051000000000043, "rtf": 0.12213163001234034, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0565", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "And there came a fear on all: and they glorified God, saying, That a great prophet is risen up among us; and, That God hath visited his people.", "target": [42, 7, 16], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 8.8616875, "sha256": "22f7ff4d419ade42b33479c7cdfefb60bf046e99656059d699a48aeb8b38fe8c", "transcript": "and there came a fear on all, and they glorified God, saying, that a great prophet is risen up among us, and, that God hath visited his people.", "decode_s": 0.6000715829432011, "cpu_s": 0.030769999999999964, "rtf": 0.06771527239515059, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 28, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0570", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "O earth, cover not thou my blood, and let my cry have no place.", "target": [18, 16, 18], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.57725, "sha256": "aa3603badbe11a57365bba576d23baf57a9d93ba8ab8c19a910c51f3d8d48e9d", "transcript": "O earth, cover not thou my blood, and let my cry have no place.", "decode_s": 0.5558050000108778, "cpu_s": 0.01654, "rtf": 0.12142771314891646, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 14, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0575", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord GOD ; Behold, I will bring a sword upon thee, and cut off man and beast out of thee.", "target": [26, 29, 8], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.0846875, "sha256": "4f39e2767b2ffc87e570de5e592f2daae3d2b75199369ce9d3bec86c2ed347a9", "transcript": "Therefore thus saith the Lord God, Behold, I will bring a sword upon thee, and cut off man and beast out of thee.", "decode_s": 0.5822228750912473, "cpu_s": 0.023575000000000124, "rtf": 0.09568656978542402, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 23, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0580", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "And Saul also went home to Gibeah; and there went with him a band of men, whose hearts God had touched.", "target": [9, 10, 26], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.7304375, "sha256": "4ffcdf06c7dd2917770fdfcfe361a936ebf34f4af3a82b2e9930732fa1f3f3bb", "transcript": "And Saul also went home to Jibi, and there went with him a band of men, whose hearts God had touched.", "decode_s": 0.5802891250932589, "cpu_s": 0.02201199999999992, "rtf": 0.10126436682945393, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 1, "units": 21, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0585", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "And Esau said to Jacob, Feed me, I pray thee, with that same red pottage; for I am faint: therefore was his name called Edom.", "target": [1, 25, 30], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 9.4295625, "sha256": "2071e242fbe8a4832a02548ea706fb8bf5ba94d41f60e7bb31c5d8ad39142ef3", "transcript": "And Esau said to Jacob, Feed me, I crave thee, with that same red pottage, for I am faint, therefore was his name called Edom.", "decode_s": 0.591525666997768, "cpu_s": 0.030430999999999875, "rtf": 0.06273097686109701, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 1, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0590", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "And when they came to Jesus, they besought him instantly, saying, That he was worthy for whom he should do this: For he loveth our nation, and he hath built us a synagogue.", "target": [42, 7, 4], "voice": "Samantha", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 8.8085625, "sha256": "7c5eee830652124e379436b8f9e6fd098c4ff014708f4f337c9df1070cc148b9", "transcript": "And when they came to Jesus, they besought him instantly, saying, that he was worthy for whom he should do this, for he loveth our nation, and he hath built us a synagogue.", "decode_s": 0.6117936249356717, "cpu_s": 0.03307900000000008, "rtf": 0.06945442289087142, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 33, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0595", "language": "en", "kind": "quotation", "text": "Therefore my people shall know my name: therefore they shall know in that day that I am he that doth speak: behold, it is I. How beautiful upon the mountains are the feet of him that bringeth good tidings, that publisheth peace; that bringeth good tidings of good, that publisheth salvation; that saith unto Zion, Thy God reigneth!", "target": [23, 52, 6], "voice": "Daniel", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 19.202625, "sha256": "9f7610009a6ca1977c797aee290e8f561fe74fedd45428a245ca345b972da986", "transcript": "Therefore my people shall know my name. Therefore they shall know in that day that I am he that doth speak. Behold, it is I how beautiful upon the mountains are the feet of him that bringeth good tidings, that publisheth peace, that bringeth good tidings of good, that publisheth salvation, that saith unto Zion, thy God reigneth.", "decode_s": 1.3213986660121009, "cpu_s": 0.0664309999999999, "rtf": 0.06881343910075319, "max_rss_bytes": 504561664, "edits": 0, "units": 58, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
